title: The Concordat
subtitle: An urgent card: the concordat with the Holy See comes before the Sejm.
new-page: true
is-card: true
view-if: {! return !!Q.S && !!Q.polish_politics_rules && PolishPolitics.concordatParliamentActive(Q) !}
on-arrival: {!
// Card of Parliament (Z — 1.05, the user's decisions of 7 XI 2026): from II to III 1925 while PPS is outside the cabinet; a stance
// that costs no action; the Sejm ratifies the concordat at the end of March (HISTORICAL_SOURCES.md, PL-EVENTS-1.05).
PolishPolitics.concordatView(Q);
!}

= The concordat

The cabinet has signed a concordat with the Holy See: Catholic instruction will be compulsory in public schools, and the clergy will swear an oath of loyalty to the state. The agreement comes before the Sejm.

- @against
- @abstain
- @later

@against
title: Vote against and demand the separation of the Church and the state
subtitle: The Left of the party is with us (−3), but we lose among Catholic voters in the countryside.
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_conc_result = PolishPolitics.concordatChoose(Q, 'against');
!}
go-to: result

@abstain
title: Abstain, so as not to provoke the partners
subtitle: PSL “Piast” will appreciate it (+3), but the Left of the party protests.
on-arrival: {!
Q.pl_conc_result = PolishPolitics.concordatChoose(Q, 'abstain');
!}
go-to: result

@later
title: Not now
subtitle: The card stays in the hand until the vote at the end of March.
go-to: root

@result
new-page: true

= The concordat

[+ pl_conc_result +]

- @root: Continue.
